{"id":"b2","level":3,"levelName":"Ulpan Bet","n":2,"of":22,"title":"Having","titleHe":"יֵשׁ לִי","goal":"Say what you have — Hebrew has no verb for it.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"There is no verb to have. You say there is to me: יֵשׁ לִי, and for the negative אֵין לִי, there isn't to me."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"יֵשׁ לִי סֵפֶר.","en":"I have a book."},{"he":"יֵשׁ לָהּ שְׁתֵּי אֲחָיוֹת.","en":"She has two sisters."},{"he":"אֵין לָנוּ זְמַן.","en":"We don't have time."},{"he":"יֵשׁ לְךָ דַּקָּה?","en":"Have you got a minute?"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"The thing owned is the grammatical subject, so nothing agrees with the owner. יֵשׁ never changes shape — only the לְ after it does."}],"vocab":[{"he":"זְמַן","en":"time","translit":"zman"},{"he":"כֶּסֶף","en":"money","translit":"kesef"},{"he":"עֲבוֹדָה","en":"work, job","translit":"avoda"},{"he":"חָבֵר","en":"friend (m.)","translit":"chaver"},{"he":"חֲבֵרָה","en":"friend (f.)","translit":"chavera"},{"he":"אָח","en":"brother","translit":"ach"},{"he":"אָחוֹת","en":"sister","translit":"achot"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["on the one hand","lives, resides","last","time"],"correct":3,"prompt":"זְמַן","translit":"zman"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["big","my house","money","bear"],"correct":2,"prompt":"כֶּסֶף","translit":"kesef"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["tail","work, job","minute","that, which (literary)"],"correct":1,"prompt":"עֲבוֹדָה","translit":"avoda"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["brother","hot","friend (m.)","day"],"correct":2,"prompt":"חָבֵר","translit":"chaver"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["grandfather","friend (f.)","if (contrary to fact)","the man"],"correct":1,"prompt":"חֲבֵרָה","translit":"chavera"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["eight (f.)","ship","brother","orange"],"correct":2,"prompt":"אָח","translit":"ach"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["sister","receives","weak","gets up"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אָחוֹת","translit":"achot"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “brother”?","options":["אָח","מִשְׁנָה","זֶרַע","הֲכִי"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “money”?","options":["בֶּטֶן","כֶּסֶף","אַחֲרוֹן","שָׁלָל"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"יֵשׁ לְךָ ___?","en":"Have you got a minute?","options":["חָבֵר","זְמַן","דַּקָּה","כֶּסֶף"],"correct":2,"full":"יֵשׁ לְךָ דַּקָּה?"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “sister”?","options":["מַמְלָכָה","עָיֵף","יַסְבִּיר","אָחוֹת"],"correct":3,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["עֲבוֹדָה","אָחוֹת","חֲבֵרָה","אָח"],"correct":2,"say":"חֲבֵרָה","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “friend (f.)”?","options":["שָׁקֵט","רְחוֹב","חֲבֵרָה","יַעַר"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"build","tokens":["לְךָ","דַּקָּה","יֵשׁ"],"answer":["יֵשׁ","לְךָ","דַּקָּה"],"en":"Have you got a minute?"},{"type":"build","tokens":["לָהּ","יֵשׁ","אֲחָיוֹת","שְׁתֵּי"],"answer":["יֵשׁ","לָהּ","שְׁתֵּי","אֲחָיוֹת"],"en":"She has two sisters."},{"type":"type","q":"Write “money” in Hebrew","answer":"כֶּסֶף","hint":"kesef"}]}